# SHAHIN-E GATE 4 CLIMB AND DESCENT
# Brief: Gate 4 independent check of the Shahin-E model (gps_denied_navigation feature).
# Home = shahin_e_runway.sdf spherical coordinates. All legs on the home latitude (due East).
# Above 20 m ArduPlane AUTO follows a straight glide slope between waypoints, so each
# slope is set by distance: at AIRSPEED_CRUISE 17 m/s
#   seq 3 -> 4 climb 200 -> 300 m over 1830 m (2500 -> 4330 m East): 0.93 m/s
#   seq 5 -> 6 descent 300 -> 200 m over 3200 m (5330 -> 8530 m East): 0.53 m/s
# seq 1 takeoff: pitch 15 = TKOFF_LVL_PITCH, alt 50 m = TKOFF_ALT (real values, unchanged).
# seq 2 climb to 200 m by 1500 m East; seq 3 settle level to 2500 m East.
# seq 4 -> 5 level at 300 m (1 km); seq 6 -> 7 level at 200 m (1 km).
# seq 8: loiter over the end at 200 m (radius WP_LOITER_RAD); no RTL, no landing.
